  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity for Biosphere Reserves and Inclusive Participation in EA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme, Strengthening Capacity for Biosphere Reserves and Inclusive Participation in Eastern Africa, aims to enhance the effectiveness, sustainability, and inclusivity of UNESCO Biosphere Reserves across the region. It will support new biosphere reserve nominations, strengthen periodic review processes, and improve integrated management planning. The programme will also promote meaningful participation of youth and women in biosphere reserve governance, conservation, and sustainable livelihood initiatives. Through capacity-building, knowledge exchange, and community-led action, the programme will contribute to biodiversity conservation, climate resilience, and sustainable development in Eastern Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
